{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "喪", "id": "喪"}, {"form": "地", "id": "地"}, {"form": "始", "id": "始"}, {"form": "就", "id": "就"}, {"form": "忍", "id": "忍"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "父母", "id": "父母"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "禽獸", "id": "禽獸"}, {"form": "罪", "id": "罪"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "苗", "id": "苗"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}, {"form": "飢", "id": "飢"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.1972245773362196, "source": "地", "target": "喪"}, {"weight": 3.1780538303479458, "source": "地", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 3.0726933146901194, "source": "地", "target": "就"}, {"weight": 2.667228206581955, "source": "地", "target": "忍"}, {"weight": 2.6026896854443837, "source": "地", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 3.295836866004329, "source": "地", "target": "罪"}, {"weight": 1.1765738301378217, "source": "上", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.302585092994046, "source": "上", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.995732273553991, "source": "上", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 1.2321436812926323, "source": "父母", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "父母", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "父母", "target": "養"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "父母", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.302585092994046, "source": "入", "target": "事"}, {"wei